     thread attribute object.

     Masks of type _c_p_u_s_e_t___t are composed using the CPU_SET macros.  If the
     user-supplied mask is not large enough to fit all of the matching CPUs,
     pptthhrreeaadd__aattttrr__ggeettaaffffiinniittyy__nnpp() fails with ERANGE.  Calls to
